msgctxt "description"
msgid "The family's records go on one shared phone as Verifiable Health Links (J4.0), and a year later a doctor back in Taifafeki reads the whole history from Onesa (J4.1). One chapter of the walkthrough, two BPMN processes, so two sub-journeys."
